  "answer": "B",
  "numerical_answer": "",
  "tolerance": "",
  "solution": "$$F = F_0\\left(\\frac{R}{R + h}\\right)^2 = 72\\left(\\frac{R}{1.5R}\\right)^2 = 72 \\times \\frac{4}{9} = 32\\ \\text{N}$$",
